        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global 501 Series Alarmed Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTouch Bar Rim Exit Device with Alarm is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty commercial and industrial applications. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor 36\" wide doors it comes packaged with a EAK500 Alarm Kit. EMERGENCY-EXIT ONLY, ALARM WILL SOUND sticker is included (field applied).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese exit devices are <b>non-handed for doors 36\" wide</b>. The latch and springs are made from long lasting high strength stainless steel. These exit devices are listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Alarm Push Bar Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Powder Coated Steel push bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch: Stainless Steel, 3/4\" throw - 5/8\" deadlatch</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" Covers 161 prep, includes latch & strike filler plates</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Surface mounted for 5/8\" stop with shim</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 3\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 41\" from finished floor to center line of push rail</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Dogging: 1/2\" of a turn 7/32\" hex key</li> -->\r\n<li>UL Listed: 12PJ SA 32524</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Fire Rating: Available Option</li> -->\r\n<li>Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Alarm Features</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Microprocessor-based alarm board</li>\r\n<li>Includes <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-mortise-cylinder-lock\">key mortise lock</a> to activate or inactivate the alarm</li>\r\n<li>When armed, alarm sounds immediately upon rail depression</li>\r\n<li>Free entry allowed based on exterior trim being used</li>\r\n<li>Tamper resistant latching (deadlocking stainless latch bolt)</li>\r\n<li>Battery powered (9V battery - not included)</li>\r\n<li>Alarm volume 103 dB at 8 feet</li>\r\n<!-- <li>LED Indicator provides visible verification of device status: Armed, Disarmed, Low Battery or Service Needed</li> -->\r\n<!-- <li>Field adjustable Alarm time: 15, 30, 60 or 120 seconds</li> -->\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Touch Bar Rim Exit Device with Alarm, GLO-ED-501ALARM-AL",
                "description": "GLO-ED-501ALARM-AL 36  Inch Wide Door Touch Bar Rim Exit Device with Alarm is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty commercial and industrial applications. It fits 36 inch doors. It comes packaged with a EAK500 Alarm Kit.\r\n",
                "keywords": "GLO-ED-501ALARM-AL, GLO-ED501 global door controls push bar door exit device, door exit push bars, Commercial emergency exit devices, 36 Inch Wide Door Push Bar Exit Devices, 36  Inch Wide Door Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices, alarm system Exit Devices, Alarm Exit Devices, Alarm panic devices, UL Listed 12PJ SA 32524 panic device with alarms,"
